Subject: [PATCH 6/6] S5: refresh vendored devicebasedauth verify library
 (a6c0d77)

Picks up the fixes reported from this integration: the OIDC client caches only successful
discovery/JWKS responses, the spend caveat uses only cronly-namespace grants, and status-list
inflation stops at its size limit.

